      "message": "Both legs of the isStatic check use compilerAttrs.asSrcs as their sole source of assembly files, which was what the original code did. So there\u0027s nothing to add to this check, according to that logic... ^^; Unless you\u0027d like me to start adding in any Src_as provided through bp2buildParseStaticOrSharedProps. I *did* add those extra checks in CcLibraryBp2Build out of paranoia, but the original code didn\u0027t use them there either. So... one of the two cases should change. ^^;",
